Package: mica-lifecycle
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: mica build <mica@example.invalid>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: static native lifecycle executable for the signed kernel image
 mica-runkit, built static for this architecture, under
 /usr/lib/mica/lifecycle/. It selects its entry point by the name it is
 invoked as: init or shutdown. Not for installation into a root: the
 assembly's kernel component reads it out of this archive and packs it into
 the initramfs, where init and the exit ramdisk's shutdown are links to the
 one file, as part of the authenticated kernel identity.
